Help: config  ? / esc to close                         
                                                       
Option          Value             Default              
wrapscan        wrapscan          wrapscan             
    n and N continue past the last or first match      
hlsearch        hlsearch          hlsearch             
    mark the rows that match a search                  
wrap            nowrap            nowrap               
    continue long diff lines on the next rows          
hideviewed      nohideviewed      nohideviewed         
    hide files marked viewed from the Files pane       
hidereviewed    nohidereviewed    nohidereviewed       
    hide hunks marked reviewed from the diff pane      
autoviewed      noautoviewed      noautoviewed         
    reviewing a file's last hunk marks it viewed       
hideresolved    nohideresolved    nohideresolved       
    hide resolved threads from the diff pane           
skipresolved    noskipresolved    noskipresolved       
    make ) and ( pass over resolved threads            
relativenumber  norelativenumber  norelativenumber     
    number diff rows by distance from the cursor       
                                                       
:set name / :set noname to change    * changed from the
default                                                





 v  ? help  zq test sequence                                